# Git and GitHub

- Default branch is `main`. Prefer small commits on a feature branch for app work.
- Do not commit `.env`, keys, tokens, or generated `dist/` / `node_modules/`.
- Do not force-push `main` or rewrite published history unless the owner explicitly asks.
- GitHub Pages comes later. Do not add a server, GitHub Action secrets, or Slack tokens for v1.
- Keep the repo static-hostable. CI, if added, should only build or lint a static site.
